e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa conta com a Corrida de 20 km \u00e0s 08:00, Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 11:00, Caminhada de 2 km \u00e0s 14:00 e Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 15:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o objetivo e causa solid\u00e1ria da iniciativa?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os fundos angariados revertem diretamente para a cria\u00e7\u00e3o de um santu\u00e1rio animal dedicado aos mais de 60 gatos acolhidos pela associa\u00e7\u00e3o Trata-me bem.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde devem ser levantados os identificadores?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega de identificadores realiza-se na porta principal do Polivalente do Bacelo a 5 de novembro (17h\u201320h) e 6 de novembro (18h\u201320h).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o pode ser formalizada atrav\u00e9s do formul\u00e1rio oficial no Google Forms disponibilizado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e acompanhado no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Solid\u00e1rio Trata-me bem 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Polivalente do Bacelo, \u00c9vora\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"\u00c9vora\", \"addressRegion\": \"\u00c9vora\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Trata-me bem \/ Ana Dias\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Solid\u00e1rio Trata-me bem 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento desportivo e solid\u00e1rio realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 7 de novembro de 2026, com ponto de encontro e partidas junto ao Polivalente do Bacelo, em \u00c9vora.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa conta com a Corrida de 20 km \u00e0s 08:00, Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 11:00, Caminhada de 2 km \u00e0s 14:00 e Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 15:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o objetivo e causa solid\u00e1ria da iniciativa?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os 